<title>POLAND: ELEKTROBUDOWA TRADES ON KERB AT PLN 59.</title>
<headline>ELEKTROBUDOWA TRADES ON KERB AT PLN 59.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Two kerb transactions in a total of 150,000 shares in Elektrobudowa were struck at 59 zlotys on the Warsaw bourse on Monday, the bourse said in a statement.</p>
<p>At the regular session, Elektrobudowa was trading at 61.5 zlotys in a 14,369-share volume.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
